彩中獎後有領奬期限嗎？<i></i></p>\n<p>六合彩攪珠翌日起即可領獎，需於60日內完成領獎手續。</p>\n<p>六合彩何時有金多寶？ <i></i></p>\n<p>六合彩金多寶並非每期都有，通常於特定節日時推出。</p>\n<p>六合彩中幾多個字先有獎？<i></i></p>\n<p>選中3個「攪出號碼」已經中七獎，固定獎金40元。</p>\n<p>六合彩通常幾時攪珠？<i></i></p>\n<p>通常每週攪珠三次，分別於星期二、四、六攪珠。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T14:02:01.078654+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1918,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:48:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:58:29.936559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T13:58:29.936559+00:00","content_hash":"dc746c15ac1fe6cc0fdf644f19fe018c15c05b80853ad0be3227d09a8ede1562","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}